 she also realizes that she actually witnessed

00:43:28.450 --> 00:43:32.873
Miss Mikami death prior to the school year,
 with her body being dumped in the dam.

00:43:32.915 --> 00:43:36.921
They must kill her to stop the calamity
 as she is already dead.

00:43:36.963 --> 00:43:41.011
Koichi grabs the pickax
 and readies himself to kill Miss Mikami,

00:43:41.011 --> 00:43:46.144
but he suddenly realizes that his aunt
 has also been dead this whole time in shock.

00:43:46.144 --> 00:43:48.147
He finally strikes the killing blow

00:43:48.147 --> 00:43:52.779
and sends her Miss Mikami to the afterlife,
 ending this curse for good.

